estro di kung fu."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Davide is a shy and nerdy 13-year-old teenager who lives in Rome, in the Esquilino district, with his mum Asia. He spends his days with his friend Yang, constantly trying to escape from the school bully, Nadir, and dreaming of winning Jasmine's heart. Passionate about movies on martial arts, Davide tries to regain self-confidence when he meets Martino, a broke b-movie actor, pretending to be a kung fu master to make his living."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zhugmiZd51SRaKGdc3mbqnS3Hoi.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bw9KBm6U7CfSiVoGGr5ItwvZLBr.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1018941,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zhugmiZd51SRaKGdc3mbqnS3Hoi.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zhugmiZd51SRaKGdc3mbqnS3Hoi.jpg","language":"it","width":850,"height":1274},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zhugmiZd51SRaKGdc3mbqnS3Hoi.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zhugmiZd51SRaKGdc3mbqnS3Hoi.jpg","language":"it","width":850,"height":1274},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j9TRlpsnWwgBdXTfvUvvBG91g6W.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j9TRlpsnWwgBdXTfvUvvBG91g6W.jpg","language":"it","width":850,"height":1274}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]}},"background":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kWXNYsLOaQz8Y83xtMJDFBiLza0.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kWXNYsLOaQz8Y83xtMJDFBiLza0.jpg","language":"it","width":1920,"height":1080},"candidates":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kWXNYsLOa